{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JkRrRwUb47PZGhoXhmjW95","type":"tool_result","content":"9095\t *        bars: [{ value: hp, max: 5, kind: 'pips' }], prompt: near && { key: 'E', label: 'Take the ledger', progress },\n9096\t *        minimap: { map, at: hero, markers: [{ x, y, kind: 'diamond' }] } });\n9097\t *      ui.toast('Checkpoint', 'The ledger is yours'); ui.show('results', { title: 'The names are safe', stats, medals })\n9098\t *    With a pause screen, it opens while game.paused and Resume unpauses. Keys, d-pad, stick and touch move the focus\n9099\t *    (up / down / left / right turn a slider or a choice, confirm presses, cancel goes back, pause or Start closes the\n9100\t *    menu); while a screen is open the game's input is held back. It honors reduced motion and the safe-area insets, CSS\n9101\t *    variables theme it (ink, paper, accent, muted, danger, line, font, titleFont), and a headless game keeps its screens'\n9102\t *    names and draws nothing.\n9103\t *    THE STANDARD MENU: every game gets one (new E.Game makes this shell for itself, and a game's own E.Shell takes over\n9104\t *    from it): the pause screen (Resume, the game's items, Settings, Controls, Full screen, Help, Save session while the\n9105\t *    page is recorded, Quit to title with a confirmation), the settings screen (Display, Sound, Comfort and the game's own settings, from game.settings) and the\n9106\t *    controls screen (every action's keys and buttons, rebound by pressing the new one, conflicts said before anything\n9107\t *    changes; the controller's dead zone, aim, symbols and vibration; the touch buttons' side, size and opacity; restore\n9108\t *    defaults). new E.Game({ menu: { items: [['Restart', fn]], settings: [...], controls: { attack: 'Sword', skill:\n9109\t *    false }, quit: 'title' } }) adjusts it; menu: false, or new E.Shell(game, { standard: false }), leaves it out.\n9110\t * ============================================================================= */\n9111\tconst SHELL_CSS = `.esh{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:20;font:14px/1.45 var(--font);color:var(--ink);--sat:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);\n9112\t--pt:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));--pr:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-right,0px));--pb:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));--pl:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-left,0px))}\n9113\t.esh *{box-sizing:border-box}.esh [hidden]{display:none!important}.esh p{margin:4px 0 0;white-space:pre-line}\n9114\t.esh h1,.esh h2{font-family:var(--title);font-weight:600;margin:2px 0 0;line-height:1.05}.esh h2{font-size:26px}\n9115\t.esh-pan{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 13px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px #0009}\n9116\t.esh-k{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}.esh-m{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}\n9117\t.esh-obj{position:absolute;left:var(--pl);top:var(--pt);max-width:min(330px,58vw)}.esh-obj b{font:600 17px var(--title);display:block}\n9118\t.esh-dist{color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:.06em}\n9119\t.esh-vit{text-align:right;min-width:120px}.esh-hb{display:flex;gap:6px;pointer-events:auto}.esh-hb button{padding:6px 10px;font-size:11px;background:var(--paper)}\n9120\t.esh-st{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em}.esh-st i{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:6px;background:var(--c)}\n9121\t.esh-pips{margin-top:5px}.esh-pips i{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;margin-left:4px;transform:rotate(45deg);background:var(--c,var(--danger))}.esh-pips i.off{opacity:.22}\n9122\t.esh-bar{height:4px;background:#ffffff1c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:6px}.esh-bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--c,var(--accent));transition:width .2s}\n9123\t.esh-cnt{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.esh-cnt b{color:var(--ink);margin-left:5px}\n9124\t.esh-toast{position:absolute;left:50%;top:var(--pt);transform:translate(-50%,calc(-100% - 30px));transition:transform .35s;max-width:min(420px,80vw);text-align:center}.esh-toast.on{transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n9125\t.esh-tut{position:absolute;left:var(--pl);bottom:var(--pb);max-width:min(330px,62vw);pointer-events:auto;padding-right:30px}\n9126\t.esh-x{position:absolute;right:6px;top:4px;background:none!important;border:0!important;color:var(--muted)!important;padding:2px 6px!important;font-size:16px!important}\n9127\t.esh-pr{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:calc(var(--pb) + 44px);transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-width:200px}\n9128\t.esh kbd{font:700 12px var(--font);border:1px solid var(--accent);border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 7px;color:var(--accent)}\n9129\t.esh-tip{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:calc(var(--pb) + 100px);transform:translateX(-50%);text-align:center;border-color:var(--danger)}\n9130\t.esh-col{position:absolute;right:var(--pr);top:var(--pt);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px}.esh-place{text-align:right;font:italic 13px var(--title);color:var(--muted)}\n9131\t.esh-mini{position:absolute;right:var(--pr);bottom:var(--pb);width:min(176px,28vw);border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);pointer-events:auto;cursor:pointer}\n9132\t.esh-keys{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:var(--pb);transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;background:rgba(8,6,14,.62);padding:5px 12px;border-radius:8px}.esh-keys kbd{margin-right:4px}\n9133\t@media (pointer:coarse){.esh-keys{display:none}}@media (max-width:640px){.esh-obj{max-width:calc(100vw - 214px)}.esh-toast{left:var(--pl);right:var(--pr);top:auto;bottom:calc(var(--pb) + 124px);max-width:none;transform:translateY(calc(100% + 160px))}.esh-toast.on{transform:none}\n9134\t.esh-pr{bottom:calc(var(--pb) + 196px)}.esh-tip{bottom:calc(var(--pb) + 262px)}}\n9135\t.esh-sh{position:absolute;inse