{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WpKx29c3iSRixU7uVBCtuf","type":"tool_result","content":"  1714 145112 PLAN.md\n14:## 0. Read this first (ground rules for the builders)\n36:### 0.1 Fetch what you build on (once, inside the dev folder)\n56:## 1. The game\n58:### 1.1 Pitch\n70:### 1.2 Pillars\n80:### 1.3 Genre and perspective (decisions)\n94:### 1.4 Core loop\n101:### 1.5 Modes (main menu, in this order)\n118:## 2. Controls and input (controller-first, keyboard and mouse native)\n120:### 2.1 The action map (custom preset `OLY_KEYS`, replaces the engine presets for the whole game)\n151:### 2.2 Per-event use of the actions\n168:### 2.3 Button prompts and glyphs (a must-build: the pixel font has no ✕ ○ □ △)\n193:### 2.4 Menus\n199:### 2.5 The game's settings (Settings → Game group, via `new E.Game({ menu: { settings: [...] } })`)\n218:## 3. UI and UX (10-foot)\n220:### 3.1 Rules\n239:### 3.2 Screens (all pixel art unless marked HTML)\n272:### 3.3 Touch-only devices\n282:## 4. Architecture\n284:### 4.1 Tech stack\n294:### 4.2 Folder layout\n308:### 4.3 Source files (load order = bundle order)\n336:### 4.4 The game object\n349:### 4.5 Scenes\n363:### 4.6 Engine changes (all marked `// OLY:` in `engine/my-3d2dge.js`; list them on the About screen)\n380:### 4.7 Randomness and determinism\n390:### 4.8 Data model\n406:### 4.9 Bundle\n429:## 5. Shared gameplay systems\n431:### 5.1 The event contract (`O.defEvent`) and the phase runner\n475:### 5.2 Pilots, intents and the autoplayer\n491:### 5.3 Formats\n503:### 5.4 Input widgets (src/12-eventkit.js; each has `update`, `press`/`read` and a 10-foot `draw`)\n518:### 5.5 Hype and YIKES TURBO\n529:### 5.6 CPU rivals and difficulty\n539:### 5.7 Results, qualifying, points, records, medals\n555:### 5.8 Yikes moments\n563:### 5.9 Ghosts\n571:### 5.10 Commentary\n583:### 5.11 Crowd, jumbotron, camera, slow-mo\n595:### 5.12 Laurels\n601:### 5.13 Tuning registry (the dev sliders' data)\n610:### 5.14 Saves\n619:## 6. The twelve events\n628:### 6.1 100m DASH — summer · Glory Stadium · mash\n662:### 6.2 JAVELIN THROW — summer · Glory Stadium infield · mash + angle\n695:### 6.3 50m FREESTYLE (short course) — summer · Splash Palace · rhythm + breath\n726:### 6.4 10m PLATFORM DIVING — summer · Splash Palace · tricks + entry timing\n758:### 6.5 ARCHERY — summer · Bullseye Lawn (seaside) · aim under sway\n785:### 6.6 WEIGHTLIFTING (clean & jerk) — summer · Iron Hall · mash + balance + timing\n811:### 6.7 SKI JUMP (large hill, K-125, HS-140) — winter · Mount Glory Jumping Hill · timing + flight balance\n843:### 6.8 DOWNHILL — winter · \"The Yikes Face\" · steering + tuck + gates\n888:### 6.9 TWO-MAN BOBSLED — winter · Glory Ice Track (dusk) · push + load + banked steering\n912:### 6.10 FIGURE SKATING (free skate) — winter · Glory Ice Palace · rhythm\n943:### 6.11 CURLING (gold medal match) — winter · Glory Curling Club · aim + weight + sweep (physics)\n976:### 6.12 ICE HOCKEY FINAL (2-on-2 + goalies) — winter · Glory Arena · team action\n1004:## 7. Content\n1010:### 7.1 Nations and their star athletes (8 = 8 lanes)\n1065:### 7.2 Venues (levels)\n1084:### 7.3 Story structure (The Games)\n1101:### 7.4 Ceremony scripts\n1139:### 7.5 Records (in-world World Records, seeded into `oly:records`)\n1157:### 7.6 Commentary banks (write ≥ 160 lines in total; samples below set the voice)\n1195:### 7.7 Pictograms, emblem, flags\n1208:### 7.8 Items, power-ups, opponents and hazards\n1221:## 8. Art and animation\n1223:### 8.1 Look (the engine's native style, pushed to its look target)\n1233:### 8.2 Pose layer (`O.Pose`, src/06-pose.js) and the engine's pose hook\n1267:### 8.3 Effects\n1275:### 8.4 Lighting per venue\n1282:### 8.5 The mascot: YIKESY\n1291:## 9. Audio (all in code)\n1293:### 9.1 Music (engine songs `{ bpm, steps: 4, tracks }`, every one original)\n1323:### 9.2 Sound effects (`audio.define`, layered voices; names → recipe)\n1337:### 9.3 Voices: `O.Voice.speak(text, voice)` (Animalese/Simlish gibberish)\n1354:### 9.4 Crowd\n1361:### 9.5 Anthems\n1369:### 9.6 Mix\n1375:## 10. Modes and flow\n1377:### 10.1 The Games (the campaign)\n1397:### 10.2 Single Event\n1402:### 10.3 Records, How to Play, Settings, About\n1416:## 11. Attract mode\n1440:## 12. Multiplayer\n1442:### 12.1 Local (the game on its own)\n1452:### 12.2 AI Hub sessions: \"Hub Heats\" in **ghost** mode\n1501:## 13. Dev mode (pause menu → \"Dev mode\"; the ` key also opens it; absent in hub sessions)\n1531:## 14. Build order and milestones\n1558:## 15. Risks and how to de-risk them\n1579:## 16. Testing\n1581:### 16.1 The one command\n1590:### 16.2 The harness (`tests/harness.mjs`)\n1601:### 16.3 Suites and what they check\n1649:### 16.4 Screenshots (only what scripts can't judge)\n1657:### 16.5 Rules\n1664:## 17. Done checklist (TASK.md → where in this plan → how it's verified)\n1691:## Appendix A: About & Credits, the chat reply and `exit-interview.json`\n0","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2086767-996d-4677-894d-e4b97c87d2db","uuid":"9484b1a8-e712-42d8-815a-0aa18b2465ef","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:33:05.926Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"  1714 145112 PLAN.md\n14:## 0. Read this first (ground rules for the builders)\n36:### 0.1 Fetch what you build on (once, inside the dev folder)\n56:## 1. The game\n58:### 1.1 Pitch\n70:### 1.2 Pillars\n80:### 1.3 Genre and perspective (decisions)\n94:### 1.4 Core loop\n101:### 1.5 Modes (main menu, in this order)\n118:## 2. Controls and input (controller-first, keyboard and mouse native)\n120:### 2.1 The action map (custom preset `OLY_KEYS`, replaces the engine presets for the whole game)\n151:### 2.2 Per-event use of the actions\n168:### 2.3 Button prompts and glyphs (a must-build: the pixel font has no ✕ ○ □ △)\n193:### 2.4 Menus\n199:### 2.5 The game's settings (Settings → Game group, via `new E.Game({ menu: { settings: [...] } })`)\n218:## 3. UI and UX (10-foot)\n220:### 3.1 Rules\n239:### 3.2 Screens